// Article 2. Assessments, the late fee, and the lien.
#require "1-association.charter".
Param assessment = $150.00
Param late-fee = $25.00
Fact month Identified by 1..12

Event month-begins Related to month
  Creates assessment-due(owner, association, month)
Duty assessment-due Holder owner Claimant association Related to month
  Due within 1 day
  Terminated by pay-assessment
Fact late Identified by owner * month
  Holds when Held(assessment-due(owner, association, month)) For 15 days
Act pay-assessment Actor owner Recipient association Related to month, amount : USD
  Valid when (amount == assessment && !late(owner, month))
          || (amount == assessment + late-fee && late(owner, month))
Fact lien Identified by owner
  Holds when (Exists month: Held(assessment-due(owner, association, month)) For 30 days)

Clause 2.1 => assessment, month-begins, assessment-due, pay-assessment
Clause 2.2 => late-fee, late, pay-assessment
Clause 2.3 => lien, assessment-due, pay-assessment.
